<title>USA: Star Port Arthur, Texas refinery coker.</title>
<headline>Star Port Arthur, Texas refinery coker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Star Enterprise took a 50,000 barrel per day (bpd) coking unit and 26,000 bpd associated hydrotreater at its Port Arthur, Texas refinery into planned turnaround Wednesday, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The turnaround is expected to last 17 days from Wednesday, the spokeswoman said. Total capacity at the refinery is estimated at 235,000 bpd, with 80,000 bpd cracking capacity.</p>
<p>Star is a 50-50 joint venture between Texaco Inc and Saudi Aramco, the Saudi state oil company.</p>
<p>-- Matt Daily, New York Energy Desk +1 212 859 1626</p>
